43. D - Updating the same record from its Business Rule can cause recursion or extra processing. [Application Automation]
44. B - Managed credentials reduce exposure and improve maintainability. [Working with External Data]
45. D - Import sets provide a staging area for external data. [Working with External Data]
46. B - Controlled flow tests reveal input, action, and permission problems. [Application Automation]
47. B - gs.eventQueue() is used server-side to generate events. [Application Automation]
48. A - Code review reduces defects and security issues before promotion. [Managing Applications]
49. A - A table with appropriately typed fields provides a maintainable data model. [Designing and Creating an Application]
50. C - ACL evaluation protects access across interfaces, not just forms. [Security and Restricting Access]

