25. In a scoped ServiceNow application, which approach is MOST appropriate for email recipients?
A. Send all application mail to every user
B. Use data-driven recipient fields, groups, or event parameters and validate who should receive the message
C. Use a table index as an email address
D. Hard-code a personal email in every script
26. In a scoped ServiceNow application, which approach is MOST appropriate for display value?
A. Remove all labels from reference fields
B. Set an appropriate display field so references show a meaningful value
C. Expose only sys_id values to end users
D. Make every field the display field
27. In a scoped ServiceNow application, which approach is MOST appropriate for choice field?
A. Use free text when consistent reporting is required
B. Use a Reference field without a related table
C. Use an Attachment field for option values
D. Use a Choice field for a controlled set of stable values
28. In a scoped ServiceNow application, which approach is MOST appropriate for display rule?
A. Use an ACL to render HTML
B. Use a transform script on every form load
C. Use a display Business Rule to place server-derived data in g_scratchpad for a form
D. Use a Scheduled Job to populate browser variables
29. In a scoped ServiceNow application, which approach is MOST appropriate for GlideAjax?
A. Use a UI Policy to query remote tables
B. Expose administrator credentials in JavaScript
C. Use synchronous GlideRecord in the browser
D. Use GlideAjax to call a client-callable Script Include for server data without reloading the form
30. In a scoped ServiceNow application, which approach is MOST appropriate for module purpose?
A. Create a module to store table data
B. Use a module as a server-side API
C. Create an application module to give users navigation to a list, record, or page
