31. In a scoped ServiceNow application, which approach is MOST appropriate for least privilege?
A. Give admin to avoid troubleshooting authorization
B. Expose records publicly and filter them in the UI
C. Grant only the roles and privileges required for the user or application task
D. Put all users in the same elevated group
32. In a scoped ServiceNow application, which approach is MOST appropriate for REST Message?
