33. In a scoped ServiceNow application, which approach is MOST appropriate for client-callable include?
A. Put server secrets into the client script
B. Return unrestricted records to any caller
C. Mark and design a Script Include appropriately for controlled GlideAjax use
D. Make every Script Include public without validation
34. In a scoped ServiceNow application, which approach is MOST appropriate for field type?
A. Use Journal for numeric calculations
B. Choose field types based on the data and required behavior, such as Date/Time, Reference, or Choice
C. Use String for every field regardless of purpose
D. Use HTML for all relationships
35. In a scoped ServiceNow application, which approach is MOST appropriate for after rule?
A. Use a dictionary label to trigger integrations
B. Use an after Business Rule when related records should be updated after the current record is committed
C. Use an onLoad Client Script for server-side related updates
D. Use a module to create audit entries
36. In a scoped ServiceNow application, which approach is MOST appropriate for application access?
A. Use auto-numbering to block other scopes
B. Configure table Application Access settings to control cross-scope operations
C. Use a UI Action label to control cross-scope calls
D. Use a report filter as the security boundary
37. In a scoped ServiceNow application, which approach is MOST appropriate for field ACL?
