B. Use a UI Policy as confidential-data protection
C. Create only a module title condition
D. Use a client script to erase the field visually
38. In a scoped ServiceNow application, which approach is MOST appropriate for branching?
A. Use branches deliberately and avoid conflicting instance work when collaborating
B. Use branching to bypass code review
C. Have every developer overwrite the same branch without coordination
