39. In a scoped ServiceNow application, which approach is MOST appropriate for auto-number?
A. Ask users to invent identifiers with no validation
B. Configure an auto-number when each record needs a readable unique identifier
C. Use the sys_updated_on value as the display number
D. Use the record short description as the guaranteed unique key
40. In a scoped ServiceNow application, which approach is MOST appropriate for scheduled execution?
A. Use Scheduled Script Execution for server-side work that must run at a defined time or interval
B. Use an onChange Client Script when no user is online
